# 类图 / 数据结构图 — v5.4 Sidebar 5 工具升级

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class SectorRow {
        +int rank
        +string name
        +string code
        +float changePct
        +string leadStock
        +float fundFlow
        +string key
    }

    class SectorDetail {
        +string sectorKey
        +string sectorName
        +float avgChg
        +int limitUp
        +int limitDn
        +int upCount
        +int dnCount
        +LeaderStock[] topStocks
        +FundFlow fundFlow
    }

    class LeaderStock {
        +string code
        +string name
        +float chg
    }

    class FundFlow {
        +float superLarge
        +float large
        +float medium
        +float small
        +float main
        +bool isEstimated
    }

    class StockListRow {
        +string code
        +string name
        +float chg
        +float turnover
        +float marketCap
        +float pe
        +int priority
    }

    class ScreenFilter {
        +int minScore
        +float minChg
        +float minVol
        +float minTurnover
        +float maxPe
        +int limit
        +string sector
    }

    class ScanParams {
        +float priceMin
        +float priceMax
        +string sectors
        +int minScore
        +float minChg
    }

    class AppState {
        +SectorRow[] sectorRankingCache
        +string sectorCurrentPeriod
        +string sectorSortOrder
        +string sectorSelectedKey
        +string sectorSelectedName
        +bool screenMode
        +bool scanPanelVisible
    }

    SectorDetail --> LeaderStock : topStocks[]
    SectorDetail --> FundFlow : fundFlow
    AppState --> SectorRow : sectorRankingCache
```
